Story - Story - The jury has reached a verdict in the first case to be tried in the case involving Dallas rapper MO3’s murder in 2020, when Melvin Noble was killed in an ambush shooting on Interstate 35E. The first man to be tried was Kewon White, who allegedly was hired by Markies Conway to murder Noble. Conway is another rapper, known as Yella Beezy, who allegedly was embroiled in a feud with MO3.

What would you need to see in the record before changing your mind?

